    "Ask me first" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先问我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask me first: the agent stops and asks you in a notification before paying (Payments only), or also before sending a message, deleting or changing account settings. Every run keeps a low-frame-rate video of the mirrored screen for the review." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先问我：agent 会在付款前停下来，用通知问你（只在付款时）；也可以设为在发送消息、删除或修改账户设置前也问你。每次运行都会保留一段低帧率的镜像屏幕录像，供回看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
