      }
    },
    "Run data is never uploaded. An export is redacted: secrets and IP addresses removed, typed text hidden, the top of every screenshot blacked out." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "运行数据不会上传。导出内容会脱敏：去掉密钥和 IP 地址，隐藏输入的文字，并涂黑每张截图的顶部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share anonymous usage stats" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "分享匿名使用统计"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open source. No data leaves this iPhone except the requests to the model endpoint you set up, and anonymous usage stats if you turn them on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开源软件。除了发往你设置的模型接口的请求，以及你开启后的匿名使用统计，没有数据离开这台 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi looks off. Turn on Wi-Fi in Control Center, then tap Try Again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无线局域网好像关着。请在控制中心打开无线局域网，然后点「重试」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The iPhone left the board's Wi-Fi. Tap Try Again to join it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 iPhone 已离开开发板的无线局域网。点「重试」重新加入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Helps improve setup and runs: which setup steps finish, run results, step counts and timings, the model provider, model speed and token counts, app and iOS version, and crash reports. Never your tasks, screenshots, model replies, keys or addresses." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用于改进设置和运行：完成了哪些设置步骤、运行结果、步数和耗时、模型服务商、模型速度和 token 用量、App 和 iOS 版本，以及崩溃报告。绝不包含你的任务、截图、模型回复、密钥或地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免费"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Billed to your OpenRouter credits. Vision models only." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从你的 OpenRouter 余额扣费。仅列出能看图的模型。"
