        }
      }
    },
    "%@ Press and hold for Take Over, Skip or Stop." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 长按通知可选择接手、跳过或停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I'll tell you when a run is done or needs your help, since you won't see this app while I work. Before paying, sending a message or deleting anything I stop and ask you in a notification: press and hold it to answer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "任务完成或需要你帮忙时我会通知你，因为我工作时你看不到这个 App。付款、发消息或删除任何东西之前，我会停下来用通知问你：长按通知即可回答。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask before risky steps" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "危险操作前先问我"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Ask before risky steps on, the agent stops and asks you in a notification before paying, sending a message, deleting or changing account settings. Every run keeps a low-frame-rate video of the mirrored screen for the review." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开“危险操作前先问我”后，Agent 在付款、发消息、删除或修改账户设置之前会停下来，用通知问你。每次运行都会保存一段低帧率的镜像屏幕视频，供回看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow sending screenshots and your task to %@ first (Settings › Model)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请先允许把截图和任务发送到 %@（设置 › 模型）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To work, ESP32 Agent sends data to the AI service you chose. Nothing is sent until you agree." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
