    "Only when you start a run, test the connection, check the calibration or save an intent" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只在你开始运行、测试连接、检查校准或保存意图时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screenshots may show anything on your screen. %@ handles them under its own privacy policy and terms; the ESP32 Agent developer never receives them. You can withdraw this anytime in Settings › Privacy." : {
