    },
    "Today's OpenRouter free-model requests are used up (50 a day, 1,000 after you buy $10 of credits). Try again tomorrow or choose a paid model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的 OpenRouter 免费模型请求已用完（每天 50 次，充值 10 美元后每天 1000 次）。请明天再试，或选择付费模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI service's daily limit is used up. Try again tomorrow or choose another model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 服务今天的额度已用完。请明天再试，或换一个模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenRouter's free models allow about 20 requests a minute and the limit was hit. Wait a minute and try again, or choose a paid model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenRouter 免费模型每分钟约 20 次请求，已达到上限。请等一分钟再试，或选择付费模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI service is rate-limiting requests. Wait a minute and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 服务正在限制请求频率。请等一分钟再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free models are rate-limited (about 20 requests a minute, 50 a day) and often busy. A run takes 20–40 requests, so runs can be slow or stop partway. A paid model works better." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免费模型有频率限制（约每分钟 20 次、每天 50 次），而且经常繁忙。一次运行需要 20–40 次请求，所以可能很慢或中途停下。付费模型效果更好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free models are rate-limited (about 20 requests a minute, 50 a day) and often busy; a run takes 20–40 requests, so runs can be slow or stop partway. Automatic picks a free vision model for each request." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免费模型有频率限制（约每分钟 20 次、每天 50 次），而且经常繁忙；一次运行需要 20–40 次请求，所以可能很慢或中途停下。“自动”会为每次请求挑选一个免费的视觉模型。"
          }
        }
      }
