    "Write Mail" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写邮件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screenshots are your choice and off by default. If you include them, text on them is pixelated and the status bar is blacked out on your iPhone, and the mail asks our model to blur anything left, like faces and photos, before anyone looks. Typed text, your model key and network names are removed. You see the mail before it is sent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "截图由你决定是否附带，默认不带。附带时，会先在你的 iPhone 上给截图里的文字打马赛克、涂黑状态栏；邮件里还会要求我们的模型在任何人查看前，把剩下的人脸、照片等也打码。输入的文字、模型密钥和网络名称都会去掉。发送前你能看到邮件内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We use what you send only to improve intents in ESP32 Agent, and never for anything else." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你发来的内容只用于改进 ESP32 Agent 的意图，不会用于任何其他用途。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Attached: an intent shared from ESP32 Agent. Screenshots were included only if I chose to, blurred on my iPhone. Use it only to improve intents in ESP32 Agent, not for anything else." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "附件是从 ESP32 Agent 分享的一个意图。只有我选择时才会附带截图，且已在我的 iPhone 上打码。仅可用于改进 ESP32 Agent 的意图，不得用于其他用途。"
          }
